timer.plain, line 1: Write "the stopwatch" instead of "the timer".

    start the timer
          ^^^^^^^^^
Try this:
    start the stopwatch
Why: A timer counts down, but Plain's stopwatch counts up from 0, like the stopwatch on a phone.

